cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this tool, please cite it as below."
title: "Tracker Watch: weekly, passive and reproducible measurement of third-party tracking on news websites"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Asenjo Tornero"
    given-names: "Jose Luis"
    email: "asenjo.jose@hotmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/joseasenjo/tracker-watch"
url: "https://joseasenjo.github.io/tracker-watch/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Weekly measurements of the third-party tracking services that 48 news websites (12 from the US, the UK, Germany and
  Spain) contact before any interaction, with the classification list, the site list and the trends compiled from the
  series. Counts, not legal conclusions. The data are under CC BY 4.0; the code of the repository is under the PolyForm
  Noncommercial License 1.0.0.
keywords:
  - tracking
  - privacy
  - GDPR
  - news websites
  - web measurement
